# Claude Control Plane (CCP) — .gitignore
#
# This is a single public repository: tracked means published. Exclusions are
# therefore limited to two kinds of file — (a) things nobody needs in order to
# develop this repository, and (b) things that carry secrets or personal data.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Workspace artifacts — planning, review, and development working files
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_workspace/
_workspace_archive_*/
ccp_report.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime artifacts — may contain user prompts / response bodies
# (privacy-sensitive). Already covered by _workspace/ above; listed
# explicitly so the privacy boundary is unambiguous.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_workspace/_jobs/
_workspace/_audits/
_workspace/_probe/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets / environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine-local context — carries vault paths, e-mail addresses and host
# paths. The rules stay here even when the file is absent, so that a copy
# reappearing on any machine is excluded from the first moment.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CLAUDE.local.md
WIKI.local.md
.obsidian-doc.local.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OMX runtime metrics — regenerated locally, never published
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.omx/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code project directory — deny by default.
# The harness itself (agents, skills, rules, changelog, shared settings) is
# tracked so that it travels with the repository. Everything else Claude Code
# writes here — session state, per-user overrides, agent memory, archived
# changelogs, shell snapshots — stays on the local machine, including files
# that future versions may add.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/settings.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node / npm
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json.bak

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / IDE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build / test artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.log
